  "interpretation": "<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1836\">\n<thead data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1325\">\n<tr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1325\">\n<th data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Result</th>\n<th data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1325\" data-col-size=\"lg\">Clinical Significance</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1836\">\n<tr data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1580\">\n<td data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1480\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Undetectable / Normal</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1480\" data-end=\"1580\">TPO antibodies not present in CSF. No evidence of autoimmune thyroid antibodies in CNS.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1708\">\n<td data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1601\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Elevated</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1708\">May suggest Hashimoto's encephalopathy, autoimmune CNS involvement, or breach in blood-CSF barrier.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1836\">\n<td data-start=\"1709\" data-end=\"1728\" data-col-size=\"sm\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"lg\" data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1836\">Further evaluation and correlation with serum TPO levels, MRI, EEG, and clinical findings are essential.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
